{"id": "g3_small_sevens_abs_sum", "signature": "solve(values)", "statement": "Given a list of integers `values`, consider the DISTINCT values v that are nonzero multiples of 7 (v % 7 == 0) and whose absolute value is strictly less than 50. Return the sum of |v| over those distinct values. Repeated values count once, but -7 and 7 are two different values, so both contribute 7. Return 0 if there are none, including for an empty list.", "tests": [{"args": [[]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[7]], "expected": 7}, {"args": [[7, -7]], "expected": 14}, {"args": [[7, 7, -7, 0]], "expected": 14}, {"args": [[49, -49, 35, -35, 50, -50]], "expected": 168}, {"args": [[0, 0]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[14, 14, -28, 42, -42, 56]], "expected": 126}, {"args": [[3, 5, -8]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[-49]], "expected": 49}, {"args": [[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[-43, -36, -14, 20, -6, -47, 0, -24, -31, 8]], "expected": 14}, {"args": [[]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[-55, -50, -13, -2, 16, -57]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[-52, 16, 0]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[-21, -59, 1]], "expected": 21}, {"args": [[44, -25, 33, -16, 54, 13, -15, -16]], "expected": 0}, {"args": [[9, -57, 44, 58]], "expected": 0}], "facts": [["arg", "values", "int_list"], ["iterate", "values"], ["remainder", "7", "0"], ["drop", "zero"], ["bound", "abs_lt", "50"], ["distinct", "original"], ["map", "abs"], ["aggregate", "sum"], ["if_empty", "0"], ["size", "values", "tiny"]], "deps": {"schema": ["seq_fold"], "uses": [], "solution_sha256": "d5675510f49ffd638afd6197cdc6313eff60de8d89aaf1b6d473753a92c8ba39", "reference_sha256": "4fee8bfe66f91b45072a54edff7b1c17f248a560a1994f1d7e21602e5e245dd3"}}